<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-LEADING TOUR OF THE MEDITERRANEAN PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-LEADING TOUR OF THE MEDITERRANEAN PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>LA GRANDE MOTTE, France 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in Wednesday's first stage of the Tour of the Mediterranean cycling race over 103 kms from Beziers:</p>
<p>1. Mario Cipollini (Italy) Saeco  two hours 11 minutes 26 seconds</p>
<p>2. Massimo Strazzer (Italy) Roslotto</p>
<p>3. Fabio Baldato (Italy) MG Technogym</p>
<p>4. Endrio Leoni (Italy) AKI</p>
<p>5. Lombardi Giovanni (Italy) Telekom</p>
<p>6. Stephane Barthe (France) Casino</p>
<p>7. Christophe Capelle (France) Cofidis</p>
<p>8. Jean-Jacques Henry France) Big Mat Auber 93</p>
<p>9. Jann Kirsipuu (Estonia) Casino</p>
<p>10. Geert Van Bondt (Belgium) Vlaanderen 2002 -- all same time as winner.</p>
</text>
